<header class="row between wrap mb16"><div><h2>亲友之间的借钱往来</h2><p class="muted small mt8">每笔独立跟踪，本金不计收支。贷款和信用卡在金融模块管理。</p></div><a class="btn" href="/debts<%= deleted?'':'?show=deleted' %>"><%= deleted?'查看有效条目':'已归档条目' %></a></header>
<div class="grid grid-3 mb16"><div class="stat"><div class="label">别人欠我</div><div class="value amount income"><%= helpers.money(receivable) %></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">我欠别人</div><div class="value amount expense"><%= helpers.money(payable) %></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">应收减应还</div><div class="value amount"><%= helpers.money(receivable-payable) %></div></div></div>
<div class="grid grid-main"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2><%= deleted?'已归档':'借钱明细' %></h2></div>
<% if(!debts.length){ %><div class="empty">还没有条目，可登记一笔或从记账页记录借出/借入。</div><% } %>
<% debts.forEach(function(d){ %><article class="debt-entry"><div class="debt-identity"><b><%= d.counterparty %> · #<%= d.id %></b><p class="tiny muted mt8"><%= d.direction==='receivable'?'应收':'应还' %> · <%= d.status==='closed'?'已结清':'待结清' %><%= d.due_date?' · 到期 '+d.due_date:'' %></p></div><div class="debt-amount"><b class="amount"><%= helpers.money(d.balance_cents) %></b><p class="tiny muted">本金 <%= helpers.money(d.principal_cents) %></p></div>
<div class="entry-actions"><a class="btn btn-sm" href="/debts/<%= d.id %>">详情与收还款</a><% if(canWrite(ledger.role)){ %><form method="post" action="/debts/<%= d.id %>/<%= deleted?'restore':'delete' %>" data-confirm="<%= deleted?'恢复此借钱条目？':'归档只隐藏条目，保留相关流水与余额，之后可以恢复。' %>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="btn btn-sm"><%= deleted?'恢复':'归档' %></button></form><% } %></div></article><% }); %></section>
<div><% if(canWrite(ledger.role)&&!deleted){ %><section class="card"><h2>登记借钱</h2><form method="post" action="/debts" class="mt16"><input type="hidden" name="operation_key" value="<%= operationKey %>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="field"><label>方向</label><select name="direction"><option value="receivable">我借给别人</option><option value="payable">我向别人借</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>对方姓名</label><input type="text" name="counterparty" required maxlength="40"></div><div class="field"><label>金额</label><input type="text" name="amount" inputmode="decimal" required></div><div class="field"><label>资金账户</label><select name="account_id"><option value="">仅登记期初时可不选</option><% form.accounts.filter(a=>a.transaction_types.split(',').includes('lend')).forEach(function(a){ %><option value="<%= a.id %>"><%= a.name %></option><% }); %></select></div><div class="field"><label>发生日期</label><input type="date" name="date" value="<%= today %>" required></div><div class="field"><label>到期日</label><input type="date" name="due_date"></div><div class="field"><label>备注</label><input type="text" name="note" maxlength="200"></div><label class="check mb16"><input type="checkbox" name="create_txn" value="1" checked>同时记录本次资金进出</label><p class="help mb16">历史已记过的借钱可取消勾选，只登记剩余期初，不会重复移动资金。</p><button class="btn btn-primary">保存</button></form></section><% } %></div></div>
